1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Rabbit and Crow, a one minute story.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Once upon a time, there was a rabbit.

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,300
He always tried to copy other animals.

4
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,940
One day he saw a crow.

5
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:25,500
The crow was sitting on a tree and doing nothing.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,740
Rabbit thought to do the same.

7
00:00:29,739 --> 00:00:36,739
He said on the ground and doing nothing when a fox saw him.

8
00:00:36,739 --> 00:00:41,739
Fox came near and ate him.

9
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:48,740
There are a lot of stories to sit and do nothing you need to be on top.

